</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thine authority and pow’r</l><l>Shall prevail from shore to shore!</l><l>All shall serve and worship Thee</l><l>In Thy kingly majesty!</l><l>Unto Thee, of kings the King,</l><l>All Thy praise shall ever ring!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, Thy kingdom stands alone,</l><l>And forever is Thy throne!</l><l>To Thy glory and Thy pow’r</l><l>We will sing forevermore!</l><l>Now to Thee, of kings the King,</l><l>All the saints Thy praises sing!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Gracious Lord, our sovereign King,</l><l>Thy dear name we love to sing!</l><l>O how sweet Thy reign and rule.</l><l>May Thy kingdom come in full!</l><l>Yet to Thee, of kings the King</l><l>Here Thy praise we gladly sing!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
